{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkvmQdxnGxSP8e7Cx9v8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'm going with **Harel, the \"מניות\" track (fund number 8522).** I'm fairly sure, not totally. What decided it: it was the first big number I saw, **24.04%** over \"3 שנים\", at the bottom of the fee range (\"0.55%\"). And Harel is a name I actually know.\n\n**How it went:**\n- **First screen:** heading \"כל המסלולים בכל החברות\". The \"קופת גמל להשקעה 143\" button was already selected, so the page was about what I came for. Then I saw \"143 מסלולים של 12 חברות\", which is way too many.\n- **Harel came up first.** I looked down the right side for the track names and the big green percents. \"מניות\" had 24.04% for 3 years and 14.64% for 5 years. The fee was \"0.55% מההיסכון\" and \"0% מההפקדות\", and there was \"7.3 מיליארד ₪\" in it. \"כללי\" was half that return, and the S&P 500 one was 13.7%. So מניות, because it grew the most.\n- **I kept scrolling** through the Mor, Analyst and Meitav groups. A few had slightly higher numbers: Analyst \"עוקב מדדים - גמיש\" had 26.39%, and Meitav \"עוקב מדדי מניות\" had 25.86%. Not that different, and Harel is cheaper and a name I trust more. I stopped around screen 7 because it was just the same rows over and over. I didn't look at the rest of the companies.\n\n**What I skipped:** the \"מה זה קופת גמל להשקעה\" link, the line under the heading about dates and \"רשות שוק ההון\", the search box, the little circle charts, the \"?\" icons, and everything under the column headers. I never opened a row's arrow.\n\n**Where I hesitated:**\n- Lots of tracks just say \"פחות מ־3 שנים\" where the return should be, so I can't compare them. I just ignored those.\n- In \"חשיפה למניות ולמט\"ח\" I don't know what \"מט\"ח\" is. I also don't get why S&P is \"99%\" and מניות is \"25%\".\n- I didn't know what \"עוד לא דווח\" with the orange \"!\" meant. It looked like a warning, so I avoided those rows.\n\n**Not sure I read right:**\n- I think 24.04% is per year, so roughly 72% over 3 years? The header says \"תשואה שנתית ממוצעת, לפני דמי ניהול\", and I don't really know what \"לפני דמי ניהול\" changes.\n- Is 0.55% of the \"חיסכון\" a lot or a little in shekels? No idea. The page never shows it in ₪.\n\n**What bugged me:** it's a huge table with no \"start here\" or recommendation. Track names repeat in every company (\"מניות\", \"כללי\", \"עוקב מדדים\"). And it doesn't tell me how to actually open the fund. I still don't know what my first step is."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1910,"cache_read_input_tokens":15569,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1910},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ec4b92bd-fb11-43ce-baec-d9892c8f6657","uuid":"101a8a2d-2485-4c95-8b2e-53cf2761cdae","timestamp":"2026-11-06T03:00:44.409Z","request_id":"req_011CgkvmQQKHuKgjFYirbZSV"}
